  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IITA - sustainable production of Cocoa in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of production and production practices in the Cocoa industry in West Africa - focus countries - Cote dIvoir, Ghana, Cameroon and Nigeria. Production has been going down, demand is increasing,  new planting of cocoa trees is done by deforesting tropical rain forests. Doing research on soils, and new trees and grafts, new genetic material, Policy etc.</narrative>
  </description>
